{"results":[{"url":"https://www.scribd.com/document/722897014/PAAA","title":"Permanent Alternate Accommodation Agreement | PDF - Scribd","raw_content":"![Scribd](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n\n# Permanent Alternate Accommodation Agreement\n\nPermanent Alternate Accommodation Agreement\n\n## Uploaded by\n\nAI-enhanced title and description\n\n# Permanent Alternate Accommodation Agreement\n\nThis document is an agreement for permanent alternate accommodation between a developer, housing society, and allottee. It details that the developer is redeveloping the housing society's land and building and will provide the allottee with a new self-contained flat of 425 square feet as permanent alternate accommodation in lieu of vacating their existing flat, as agreed upon in a prior redevelopment agreement.\n\n# Permanent Alternate Accommodation Agreement\n\nPermanent Alternate Accommodation Agreement\n\n## Uploaded by\n\nAI-enhanced title and description\n\n### Read this document in other languages\n\n## Share this document\n\n![]()\n\n## Footer menu\n\n## About\n\n## Support\n\n## Legal\n\n## Social\n\n## Get our free apps\n\n![Scribd - Download on the App Store]()\n![Scribd - Get it on Google Play]()\n\n## About\n\n## Legal\n\n## Support\n\n## Social\n\n## Get our free apps\n\n![Scribd - Download on the App Store]()\n![Scribd - Get it on Google Play]()","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.zaubacorp.com/RAAZ-MOHAMMED-ABDULSAMAD-PATHAN-06382177","title":"RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN | ZaubaCorp","raw_content":"![ZaubaCorp](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_logo.svg?aGrEvSd)\n![ZaubaCorp](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_logo.svg?aGrEvSd)\n\n###### By Industry\n\n###### By Team\n\n![](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_search.svg?aGrEvSd)\n![Cart](/public/static/v2/assets/profile/ic_cart.svg?aGrEvSd)\n![](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_arrow_left.svg?aGrEvSd)\n![](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_search.svg?aGrEvSd)\n![](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_search.svg?aGrEvSd)\n\n# RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN\n\n![](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_hashtag.svg?aGrEvSd)\n\nFor latest information about the director, visit [MCA](https://www.mca.gov.in/).\n\n## About RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN\n\nRAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN is a director registered with Ministry of Corporate Affairs. Their Director Identification Number (DIN) is 06382177. RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN is/has been associated with 9 companies.\n\n![](/public/static/v2/assets/company/ic_directors.svg?aGrEvSd)\n\nThis is just one Director. Want to discover lot more?\n\n### Companies Associated With\n\n| Company | Designation | Date of Appointment |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [SHANTEE HOMES REALTY LLP](https://www.zaubacorp.com/SHANTEE-HOMES-REALTY-LLP-AAC-1302) | Designated Partner | 27-Feb-2014 |\n| [SHANTEE PARAMOUNT REALTORS LLP](https://www.zaubacorp.com/SHANTEE-PARAMOUNT-REALTORS-LLP-AAI-0605) | Designated Partner | 20-Dec-2016 |\n| [SHANTEE HOMEMAKERS LLP](https://www.zaubacorp.com/SHANTEE-HOMEMAKERS-LLP-AAZ-4685) | Designated Partner | 15-Nov-2021 |\n| [SHANTEE STAR HOMEMAKER LLP](https://www.zaubacorp.com/SHANTEE-STAR-HOMEMAKER-LLP-ABA-8969) | Designated Partner | 18-Apr-2022 |\n| [SHANTEE GLOBAL REALTY LLP](https://www.zaubacorp.com/SHANTEE-GLOBAL-REALTY-LLP-ACA-9297) | Designated Partner | 02-May-2023 |\n| [SAFFRONSCAPE HOMEMAKERS LLP](https://www.zaubacorp.com/SAFFRONSCAPE-HOMEMAKERS-LLP-ACA-9298) | Designated Partner | 02-May-2023 |\n| [MALVANI VR CONSTRUCTIONS LLP](https://www.zaubacorp.com/MALVANI-VR-CONSTRUCTIONS-LLP-ACI-2183) | Designated Partner | 05-Jul-2024 |\n| [SHANTEE CONSTRUCTION & ENGINEERING PRIVATE LIMITED](https://www.zaubacorp.com/SHANTEE-CONSTRUCTION-AND-ENGINEERING-PRIVATE-LIMITED-U70102MH2015PTC269104) | Director | 12-Oct-2015 |\n\n### Past Companies Associated With\n\n| Company | Designation | Date of Appointment | Date of Cessation |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [BISTA SOLUTIONS PRIVATE LIMITED](https://www.zaubacorp.com/BISTA-SOLUTIONS-PRIVATE-LIMITED-U72900MH2011PTC215792) | Additional Director | 15-Sep-2012 | 10-Jun-2013 |\n\n## Timeline of RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN\n\n## “Assess financial performance of all companies under a director.”\n\n![](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_arrow_left.svg?aGrEvSd)\n![](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_arrow_left_primary.svg?aGrEvSd)\n![ZaubaCorp](/public/static/v2/assets/ic_logo_white.svg?aGrEvSd)\n\n###### Solutions\n\nCopyright © 2026 Zauba Corp. All rights reserved.\n\n#### Information Required\n\nPlease provide the following details to proceed with the purchase.\n\nYour contact details will only be used for the purpose of delivering reports.\n\n## Purchase Company Reports\n\nYou have the following companies in your cart. To add more companies to cart, you may close this window and continue adding other companies to your cart.\n\nReports are created based on all the documents filed by the company till date\n\n#### Purchase Company Reports\n\nYour cart is empty. You may add a company to your cart by clicking on \"Purchase Report\" on any company profile page.\n\n## Purchase Company Report\n\nYou have the following companies in your cart. To add more companies to cart, you may close this window and continue adding other companies to your cart.\n\nReports are created based on all the documents filed by the company till date\n\n## Purchase Company Report\n\nYou have the following companies in your cart.\n\nYou will be redirected to a secure payment page to complete your payment.\n\nReports are created based on all the documents filed by the company till date\n\n## Purchase Company Report\n\nYou have the following companies in your cart.\n\nYou will be redirected to a secure payment page to complete your payment.\n\nReports are created based on all the documents filed by the company till date","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.axis.bank.in/auction-notices-retail","title":"Latest Retail Property & Asset Auction Notices for Buyers | Axis Bank","raw_content":"[![Axis Bank Logo](/assets/images/logo.svg \"A